    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d435">

                <pb facs="0470" n="386" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg386"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. No. 763.72112Aml/59</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Curtis</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-02-17T23:00:00-05:48">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 17, 1918, 11 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received February 18, 4.45
                        p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>President this afternoon in the presence of De Hart and
                    others stated to me that as soon as favorable decision by the War Trade Board
                    was received he would open traffic between Amapala and San Lorenzo to every one.
                    He had earlier assured De Hart that if he could get the
                    bulk of this in open competition the National Agency would withdraw
                    entirely.</p>
                <p>Please use every effort to get the War Trade Board to render an early decision as
                    delays are arousing official and public resentment here.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Curtis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
